(1) Most likely root cause: Stale sell orders from previous trading sessions are pinning inventory and preventing new sells.

(2) One-line diagnostic command to confirm: ls /trading/orders/sell/*.order-datetime > 7 days ago

(3) Safest fix that does NOT break the running F41 OANDA daemons: Remove stale sell orders using find /trading/orders/sell -type f -mtime +7 -exec rm {} \;
